# ==========================================
# ToFu (xray-box) - Git Ignore Rules
# ==========================================

# --- 1. 敏感信息与私密凭据 (严禁泄露至公网) ---
*.env
node_info.env
nodes.txt
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
*.cer
*.uuid

# --- 2. 服务器动态生成配置与运行数据 ---
config.json
client_config.json
*.log
*.pid

# --- 3. 预编译二进制与规则数据库 (由脚本动态拉取) ---
xray
xray.exe
geoip.dat
geosite.dat
*.dll
*.so

# --- 4. 本地临时文件、个人笔记与废弃旧版本脚本 ---
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~
*.txt
xray-box.sh

# --- 5. 操作系统缓存与开发工具环境 ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
